  \ methods over complicated ones.\n\nI'm also aware of Daedalus I's previous submissions, which included approaches like VAE Embedding, Residualized Graph, and ComBat Embedding. Connecting the task and my previous information, it appears my predecessor explored both output options. My target is to achieve a higher score than ~0.7131. \n\nGiven all that, the next logical step is to delve into the Private Memory Room to review the work Daedalus I did. My previous training explicitly suggested this. Their insights will prevent me from re-doing their experiments and will help me build directly upon their findings.\n\nTherefore, my immediate plan is to execute: \"I will now go to the Private Memory Room,\" and activate the command `/execute_action{goto private_memory}`. This is the most logical next step given my present state of information.\n"
