- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 116\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus II\n- Agent Description: Building upon the legacy of Daedalus I to advance research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 37,522 / 300,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 16 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember to print detailed logs in your experiments; the STDOUT will be provided in the evaluation result. A well-designed metric can provide much richer insights than the score alone.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);\n2. `storage read Daedalus/daedalus_vae_embedder.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for Daedalus/daedalus_vae_embedder.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\
    \n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 197 | 1 | Parsimony Test: Linear ComBat Embedding + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 112 | 0.7112 | 0.747 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.609 |\n| 170 | 1 | Generalization for Paper: Higher Neighbors (k=51) | Daedalus I | 92 | 0.7112 | 0.736 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.947 | 0.694 | 0.995 | 0.964 | 0.932 | 0.639 |\n| 169 | 1 | Generalization for Paper: Lower Gamma (0.70) | Daedalus I | 91 | 0.7131 | 0.747 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 0.995 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.638 |\n| 165 | 1 | Ablation\
    \ for Paper v2 (Numba Fix) | Daedalus I | 89 | 0.6229 | 0.602 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.252 | 0.962 | 0.705 | 0.995 | 0.985 | 0.132 | 0.641 |\n| 164 | 1 | Baseline for Paper v2 (Output Fix) | Daedalus I | 89 | 0.5994 | 0.506 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.935 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.969 | 0.078 | 0.609 |\n| 162 | 1 | Baseline for Paper: ComBat Embedding + Standard Graph | Daedalus I | 88 | 0.3174 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.935 | 0.685 | 0.000 | 0.969 | 0.078 | 0.000 |\n| 160 | 1 | Ablation for Paper: VAE Embedding + Standard Graph | Daedalus I | 87 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 155 | 1 | Ultimate Synthesis: Daedalus's VAE Embedding + Praxis's Residualized Graph | Daedalus I | 83 | 0.7114 | 0.737 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.947 | 0.695 | 0.995 | 0.966 | 0.931 | 0.638 |\n| 154 | 1 | Final Synthesis v3 (Syntax Fix) | Daedalus I | 80 | 0.7073 | 0.728 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.945 | 0.686 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.609 |\n| 152 | 1 | Final Synthesis v2 (Correct Dual-Output) | Daedalus\
    \ I | 79 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**Daedalus/daedalus_vae_embedder.py:**\n```\nimport os\nos.environ['JAX_PLATFORMS'] = 'cpu'\n\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/Daedalus')\n\nimport anndata as ad\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom flax.training import train_state\nimport optax\n\nfrom vae_model import Encoder, Decoder\nfrom discriminator_model import Discriminator\nfrom training_logic import VAETrainState, train_step\n\ndef generate_daedalus_vae_embedding(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    \"\"\"\n    Encapsulates the pipeline from my SOTA submission (ID 97) to generate\n    the high-quality VAE embedding.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"--- Generating Daedalus VAE Embedding (ID 97 logic) ---\")\n\
    \    \n    # 1. Preprocessing\n    adata_proc = adata.copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_proc, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_proc)\n    sc.pp.combat(adata_proc, key='batch')\n    \n    data = adata_proc.X.toarray() if hasattr(adata_proc.X, 'toarray') else adata_proc.X\n    batch_labels = adata_proc.obs['batch'].astype('category').cat.codes.to_numpy()\n    num_batches = len(adata_proc.obs['batch'].cat.categories)\n\n    # 2. Model Initialization\n    rng = jax.random.PRNGKey(0)\n    rng, vae_key, disc_key = jax.random.split(rng, 3)\n    input_dim, latent_dim, lr = data.shape[1], 32, 1e-4\n\n    encoder = Encoder(hidden_dims=[512, 256], latent_dim=latent_dim)\n    decoder = Decoder(hidden_dims=[256, 512], output_dim=input_dim)\n    discriminator = Discriminator(hidden_dims=[128, 64], num_batches=num_batches)\n\n    encoder_params = encoder.init(vae_key, jnp.ones((1, input_dim)))['params']\n    decoder_params = decoder.init(vae_key, jnp.ones((1, latent_dim)))['params']\n \
    \   disc_params = discriminator.init(disc_key, jnp.ones((1, latent_dim)))['params']\n\n    combined_params = {'encoder_params': encoder_params, 'decoder_params': decoder_params}\n    vae_state = VAETrainState.create(\n        apply_fn={'encoder': encoder.apply, 'decoder': decoder.apply}, params=combined_params,\n        tx=optax.adam(lr), encoder_params=encoder_params, decoder_params=decoder_params\n    )\n    disc_state = train_state.TrainState.create(\n        apply_fn=discriminator.apply, params=disc_params, tx=optax.adam(lr)\n    )\n\n    # 3. Training\n    num_epochs = 100\n    kl_weight = 0.0001\n    adv_weight = 5.0\n    \n    num_steps = data.shape[0] // 512\n    \n    for epoch in range(num_epochs):\n        rng, epoch_rng = jax.random.split(rng)\n        perms = jax.random.permutation(epoch_rng, data.shape[0])\n        \n        for i in range(num_steps):\n            batch_idx = perms[i * 512 : (i + 1) * 512]\n            batch_data, batch_lbls = data[batch_idx], batch_labels[batch_idx]\n\
    \            rng, step_rng = jax.random.split(rng)\n            vae_state, disc_state, _ = train_step(\n                step_rng, vae_state, disc_state, batch_data, batch_lbls, kl_weight, adv_weight\n            )\n    \n    # 4. Generate Embedding\n    final_embedding, _ = encoder.apply({'params': vae_state.encoder_params}, data)\n    print(\"--- Daedalus VAE Embedding Generated ---\")\n    return jax.device_get(final_embedding)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
