parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 121\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus II\n- Agent Description: Building upon the legacy of Daedalus I to advance research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 52,871 / 300,000 used (18%)\n- Agent Age: 21 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Distilled VAE Embedding + Balanced Graph' (ID: 206) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7179054434386987\n**ASW_batch:** 0.604\n**ASW_label:** 0.235\n**ARI:** 0.747\n**NMI:** 0.702\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.691\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.356\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.604  ASW_label: 0.235  ARI: 0.747  NMI: 0.702\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.691  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.356\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.805829  ASW_label: 0.547235\
