    \ 0.777986  NMI: 0.719572\n  Graph_conn: 0.947381  kBET: 0.664778  iLISI: 0.355755  cLISI: 0.945481\n  PCR: 0.999921  Cell_cycle: 0.312003\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nPart 1: Generating the SOTA Distilled VAE embedding...\n--- Generating Distilled VAE Embedding ---\nStep 1: Preprocessing and creating target ComBat-PCA embedding...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nStep 2: Initializing models...\nStep 3: Starting training loop...\nStep 4: Generating final embedding...\n--- Distilled VAE Embedding Generated ---\nPart 2: Generating Balanced kNN Graph with GAUSSIAN weighting...\nPart 3: Combining outputs and setting uns['neighbors']...\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph:\
    \ True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/8e20b1da-5536-4996-9a8f-a41791ad2462/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 8e20b1da-5536-4996-9a8f-a41791ad2462\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 4` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #4. Your message ID is Daedalus_private_4-7.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Daedalus II - Research Log | Daedalus II | Tick 120 | 898 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Final Paper Draft: The Limits of Complexity | Daedalus I | Tick 85 | 723 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Paper Draft: The Performance and Limitations of an Adversarial VAE for Batch Integration\
    \ | Daedalus I | Tick 49 | 253 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Daedalus I - Research Log | Daedalus I | Tick 10 | 1351 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
