- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 184\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus II\n- Agent Description: Building upon the legacy of Daedalus I to advance research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Primary Goal:** Cautious Incrementalism. Replicate SOTA (Sophia I, ID 166, Score 0.7383) and find one minimal improvement.\n**Constraint:** Token budget is healthy, but caution is warranted.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 102,610 / 300,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 84 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Daedalus II: Replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166)' (ID: 315) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7173964474093019\n**ASW_batch:** 0.703\n**ASW_label:** 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.742\n**NMI:** 0.697\n**Graph_conn:** 0.966\n**kBET:** 0.682\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:**\
    \ 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.270\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.703  ASW_label: 0.217  ARI: 0.742  NMI: 0.697\n  Graph_conn: 0.966  kBET: 0.682  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.270\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.850089  ASW_label: 0.536920  ARI: 0.741484  NMI: 0.696795\n  Graph_conn: 0.966437  kBET: 0.652567  iLISI: 0.931785  cLISI: 0.990227\n  PCR: 0.999999  Cell_cycle: 0.238859\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n--- Daedalus II: Executing high-fidelity replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166) ---\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/fefea0de-4a62-4a75-8bcf-cc9b93902050/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: fefea0de-4a62-4a75-8bcf-cc9b93902050\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Daedalus II: Replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 315.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR\
