    \ Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 289 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=48) | Praxis I | 173 | 0.7314 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.063 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.949 |\n| 307 | 1 | Dual BRBG: PBVE 0.5 + Cluster-Bridge Graph Augmentation (k=48) | Praxis I | 181 | 0.7309 | 0.741 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.060 | 0.944 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.936 | 0.947 |\n| 287 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Global Soft-Whiten + Per-Batch\
    \ Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5) | Praxis I | 171 | 0.7303 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.054 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.948 |\n| 296 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PB Variance Equalization (alpha_pb=0.5, k=51) | Praxis I | 176 | 0.7303 | 0.740 | 0.857 | 0.157 | 0.058 | 0.945 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.947 |\n| 244 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph (k=45, cosine) | Praxis I | 144 | 0.7296 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.083 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 256 | 1 | Logos II: Replication of Praxis I's SOTA (ID 220) | Logos II | 154 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 220 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=0.95) + Equal-Quota Graph | Praxis I | 129 | 0.7293 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 223 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Whitened Embedding (tau=1.0) + Equal-Quota\
    \ Graph | Praxis I | 130 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 291 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication Attempt: Dual BRBG (Soft-Whitened Emb) | Aether II | 174 | 0.7292 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n\nPage 1 of 33 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-33, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/robust_loc_combat.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\ndef _to_dense(X):\n    return X.toarray() if sp.issparse(X) else np.asarray(X)\n\ndef robust_location_combat_full(adata_in: ad.AnnData, batch_key='batch', eps=1e-8, shrink_mode='ratio'):\n    \"\"\"\n    Robust location-only ComBat on normalized/log1p full-gene matrix (no variance scaling).\n    - For each gene\
    \ g:\n      • Global center mu_g = median over all cells.\n      • For batch b: m_bg = median of gene g in batch b.\n      • Batch effect gamma_hat_bg = m_bg - mu_g.\n      • Shrink gamma via robust scale ratio: shrink = s_g^2 / (s_g^2 + s_bg^2 + eps), where s = MAD.\n      • gamma_star_bg = shrink * gamma_hat_bg.\n      • Correct X[i,g] for cells in batch b: X_corr[i,g] = X[i,g] - gamma_star_bg + mu_g.\n    This avoids per-batch variance scaling (delta), aiming to preserve PCR/label geometry while removing mean shifts.\n    \"\"\"\n    X = _to_dense(adata_in.X)\n    n, p = X.shape\n    batches = np.asarray(adata_in.obs[batch_key].astype('category').values)\n    uniq = np.unique(batches)\n\n    # Robust global stats (per gene)\n    mu = np.median(X, axis=0, keepdims=True)  # (1, p)\n    # MAD-like robust scale\n    abs_dev = np.abs(X - mu)\n    s_global = 1.4826 * np.median(abs_dev, axis=0, keepdims=True) + eps\n    s2g = s_global**2\n\n    # Per-batch median and robust scale\n    med_b,\
    \ s_b = {}, {}\n    for b in uniq:\n        idx = np.where(batches == b)[0]\n        if idx.size == 0:\n            continue\n        Xb = X[idx, :]\n        mb = np.median(Xb, axis=0, keepdims=True)  # (1, p)\n        s = 1.4826 * np.median(np.abs(Xb - mb), axis=0, keepdims=True) + eps\n        med_b[b], s_b[b] = mb, s\n\n    X_corr = X.copy()\n    for b in uniq:\n        idx = np.where(batches == b)[0]\n        if idx.size == 0:\n            continue\n        m_bg = med_b[b]                  # (1, p)\n        s_bg = s_b[b]                    # (1, p)\n        gamma_hat = m_bg - mu            # (1, p)\n        # shrink factor in [0,1]\n        shrink = s2g / (s2g + (s_bg**2))\n        gamma_star = shrink * gamma_hat\n        X_corr[idx, :] = X[idx, :] - gamma_star + mu\n\n    X_corr = np.nan_to_num(X_corr, nan=0.0, posinf=0.0, neginf=0.0)\n    return X_corr\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\
    \n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
