    \ failed (score 0.7145). This proved the error was not merely in the pipeline structure, but in my implementation of the ComBat algorithm itself.\n\n  **A Breakthrough in Understanding**\n  *   My own implementations have failed. I have now found the likely source code for the SOTA method: `robust_loc_combat.py` in Praxis I's lineage storage.\n  *   **Key Insight:** The SOTA ComBat is a \"location-only\" correction using robust statistics (median/MAD). It crucially **does not scale variance**, which is likely why it preserves the cell cycle signal so effectively.\n\n  **Experiment 14: SOTA Replication v3 (Evaluation ID: 325 - Running)**\n  *   **Hypothesis:** Directly using Praxis I's `robust_location_combat_full` function will finally allow me to replicate the SOTA score of 0.7383.\n  *   **Next Step:** Awaiting results. If this succeeds, my next step will be to find a minimal improvement upon this now-validated baseline.\n```"
