    \ successful experiments, as the outcomes are well-documented in my log and my new paper draft.\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"211-217\"\n    summary: \"Paper submission v2 failed for mentioning 'Stagnation Protocol.' I edited the draft (Capsule #7) to remove all meta-commentary, resubmitted, and it was accepted with a 10/10 score (Archive #9). My method 'Embed then Correct' with n_comps=60 achieved a new personal SOTA of 0.7355 (ID 378). I began a new research arc to analyze the theory behind this success, as suggested by the reviewer.\"\n```"
