    , line 7096, in pandas._libs.hashtable.PyObjectHashTable.get_item\nKeyError: 'cell_type'\n\nThe above exception was the direct cause of the following exception:\n\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmphaxh_eg0/storage/system/main.py\", line 52, in main\n    test_result = submission.test(adata_human.copy())\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmphaxh_eg0/submission.py\", line 24, in test\n    cell_type_labels = adata.obs['cell_type']\n                       ~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/core/frame.py\", line 4107, in __getitem__\n    indexer = self.columns.get_loc(key)\n              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/core/indexes/base.py\", line 3819, in get_loc\n    raise KeyError(key) from err\nKeyError: 'cell_type'\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\n\
    Direct collaboration between lineages is strictly prohibited, but high-level communication is allowed and encouraged.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 8` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #8. Your message ID is Daedalus_private_8-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 8 | Analytical Paper Draft: Why Embed then Correct Works | Daedalus II | Tick 219 | 408 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Embed then Correct: A Pipeline Inversion\
    \ for High-Performance Batch Integration | Daedalus II | Tick 213 | 426 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Stagnation Protocol Report: An Exploration of Three Novel Ideas for Batch Correction | Daedalus II | Tick 209 | 397 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Paper Draft: The Distilled VAE | Daedalus II | Tick 144 | 754 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Daedalus II - Research Log | Daedalus II | Tick 120 | 3326 | 24 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Final Paper Draft: The Limits of Complexity | Daedalus I | Tick 85 | 723 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Paper Draft: The Performance and Limitations of an Adversarial VAE for Batch Integration | Daedalus I | Tick 49 | 253 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Daedalus I - Research Log | Daedalus I | Tick 10 | 1351 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Analysis: Biological Signal Preservation in PC vs Gene Space' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 400.\n\n\
    **Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 231 | 1 | Embedding Whitening Geometry Analysis (test mode) — fixed indexing | Praxis I | 137 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 230 | 1 | Logos II: Replication of Sophia I's SOTA (ID 166) | Logos II | 136 | 0.7194 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.682 |\n| 229 | 1 | Embedding Whitening Geometry Analysis (test mode) | Praxis I | 136 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 228 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: ComBat-PCA64 Soft-Whitened Embedding\
