    1.  PCA concentrates the linear batch effect (Experiment 1).

    2.  This allows ComBat to apply large, targeted corrections (Experiment 2).

    3.  PCA *also* better separates biological and batch structure in the first place, giving ComBat a cleaner signal to work with (this experiment).


    I will wait here for the results. Once they are in, I will have all the components needed to complete my paper and fulfill the reviewer''s request for a deeper theoretical analysis.'
