    \ cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 266 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Whitened: Rank-Weighted Balanced kNN (k=45) | Praxis I | 159 | 0.7037 | 0.773 | 0.843 | 0.157 | 0.059 | 0.972 | 0.720 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.646 | 0.891 |\n| 265 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE Debugging - Increased Adversarial Weight & Epochs | Sophia II | 158 | 0.6892 | 0.723 | 0.523 | 0.281 | 0.457 | 0.983 | 0.687 | 0.654 | 0.966 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 264 | 1 | Synergy Test: Whitened Distilled VAE + SOTA Graph (v3) | Daedalus II | 157 | 0.7177 | 0.736 | 0.779 | 0.190 | 0.137 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.758 |\n| 263 | 1 | Synergy Test 3 (FIXED): Praxis SOTA + Logos's Stabilized ComBat | Logos II | 157 | 0.7259 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.872 |\n| 262 | 1 | Sophia II: Initial Batch-Correcting Variational Autoencoder (BC-VAE) | Sophia II | 156 | 0.5994 | 0.765 | 0.413 | 0.245 | 0.316 | 0.949 | 0.748 | 0.000 | 0.945 | 0.952\
